  "solution_ref": "$\\mathrm P(t,t^2)$, 직선 $\\mathrm{OP}$: $y=tx$, $tx=2tx-1$ → $\\mathrm Q\\left(\\frac1t,1\\right)$. $\\overline{\\mathrm{PQ}}=(1-t^2)\\sqrt{\\frac1{t^2}+1}$. $\\lim\\frac{\\overline{\\mathrm{PQ}}}{1-t}=\\lim(1+t)\\sqrt{\\frac1{t^2}+1}=2\\sqrt2$",
